{"id":"a4555bf0410990a9","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Immediate Successor Set","display":"df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set — ZFC Tree10 Immediate Successor Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set — ZFC Tree10 Immediate Successor Set","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set — ZFC Tree10 Immediate Successor Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,T,t\\in V\">\\(I,T,t\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (tree-of-sequences predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md</a>；序数索引函数的长度为其定义域，允许有限及超限长度。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}immediate\\text{-}successor\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S(I,T,t)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq u\\})\\land(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha,A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(u,\\alpha,A))\\land t\\in T\\land I=\\{u\\in T:t\\subsetneq u\\land\\operatorname{dom}(u)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}immediate\\text{-}successor\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S(I,T,t)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq u\\})\\land(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha,A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(u,\\alpha,A))\\land t\\in T\\land I=\\{u\\in T:t\\subsetneq u\\land\\operatorname{dom}(u)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary immediate successor definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"44c6814fd2d8eda0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (tree-of-sequences predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"44c6814fd2d8eda0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S$ 使用 [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md]]；序数索引函数的长度为其定义域，允许有限及超限长度。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,T,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}immediate\\text{-}successor\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S(I,T,t)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq u\\})\\land(\\forall u\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha,A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(u,\\alpha,A))\\land t\\in T\\land I=\\{u\\in T:t\\subsetneq u\\land\\operatorname{dom}(u)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(t)\\}\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1436,"backlinks":[{"id":"b88eece05b709926","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10ImmediateSuccessorSet}_S$ is the immediate-successor-set predicate (see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3766","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-immediate-successor-set]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["d25b709595952a78","44c6814fd2d8eda0"]}